# v0.28.63 — VC++ runtime DLLs are staged into here by the Windows
# release-CI step from the runner's Visual Studio install. Never
# checked in — EXCEPT the placeholder.dll below, which exists so
# the tauri.windows.conf.json overlay's `resources/vc/*.dll` glob
# resolves cleanly in dev mode when the real DLLs aren't staged.
/resources/vc/*
!/resources/vc/placeholder.dll
